{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "51173eac6e77483c11414c3c9e4221ed61ee91e6718b20c30ddfd8156d2554dd", "ja": "奪取したアタッシェケースには、ナノマシン\nを混入した違法ドラッグが入っていた。\nこの薬は『ユニーク』という名の特殊能力者\nには効かないと話すモーガン。それは任務に\n携わるスタークス達の共通点でもあった。", "zh": "夺得的手提箱里，装着混入了纳米\n机器人的违禁药物。\n摩根表示，这种药对名为“异能者”的\n特殊能力者不起作用。而这也是参与\n这项任务的斯塔克斯等人的共同点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "8015453e69e99a33d6a4e0be69d7a6acc61243e5d779279a59c76461c4def21a", "ja": "倉庫街……", "zh": "仓库街……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1001_kurohuku", "source_sha256": "5309741da3d16b3c10ad1117976d327b339605cf881394d4891afa827982a2f2", "ja": "ごきげんよう、事務総長殿。\n例のものはご用意いただけたかな？", "zh": "您好，事务总长阁下。  \n您准备好那件东西了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1002_jimusotyo", "source_sha256": "c9b1386f229fc062400247961c2dd19ecc3939053c0d900c27b223e8927cfe90", "ja": "ええ、ここに。これさえあれば、我々の理想とする\n世界が、速やかに訪れる事でしょう……。", "zh": "是的，就在这里。只要有了这个，我们理想中的世界很快就会到来吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "cc3a513d68882826184467bbb4e37fac6ce26fc161631b703c0c3e37f262f627", "ja": "（あれがモーガンの言っていたアタッシェケースか。\n目くらましで混乱させれば……！）", "zh": "（那就是摩根说的手提箱吗？\n只要用强光让他们陷入混乱……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1004_hurashu", "source_sha256": "85bade74398fbeee14a8d8c1adb3a4df6fddb075a9f15db07865ade86f33fbd1", "ja": "ピカッ！", "zh": "闪亮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1005_kurohuku", "source_sha256": "18346d2c750cb11624ff4902d442672a694fea55a13b138e9b6e58fe12315c98", "ja": "ぐわっ！？\nな、なんだこの光は……！？", "zh": "哇啊！？\n这、这光是怎么回事……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1006_kurohukunotesita", "source_sha256": "65cdfdccf340a02a74f2bcb7d58fb6ff33c7308e9f4c8f1a18364c06396ed563", "ja": "あ、アタッシェケースが奪われたぞ！？\n誰か、追えっ！　追えーっ！！", "zh": "啊，手提箱被抢走了！？\n谁来追啊！追——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1007_jimusotyo", "source_sha256": "e3824686aa4a0e0ddc61c84e7e4d4c0a3572c997ddef94696b49883d40db90ad", "ja": "ううっ……！　つ、追跡は任せましたよ！\n私は急いで戻ります……！！", "zh": "呜呜……！追、追踪就交给你了！\n我先赶紧回去……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "ba1d877ad8ac9fe506b2a65ec2e2d8a2c68a31fe74ba6a2ee8ae5acbb0a60ded", "ja": "よし、うまくいったぞ！　事務総長はひとりで戻る、\nひとまずモーガンの言ったとおりになっているが……。", "zh": "好，成功了！事务总长会一个人回来，暂时算是如摩根所说的那样，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1009_jimusotyo", "source_sha256": "45fd52101cb9705493fb71c42a808d4dd02b082c0cd8946206d7d2d0bc75c154", "ja": "なんなんだ一体……！　この取引が失敗するなんて、\n聞いてないぞ！　なぜ教えない、モーガン！！", "zh": "这到底是怎么回事……！这笔交易居然会失败，我可没听说过！为什么不告诉我，摩根！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1010_jimusotyo", "source_sha256": "2327e2e5609f84d7cea15cc8d8811f5d05e87e8ad519b4137dd34f198c6ab924", "ja": "早く、正しい未来を……！", "zh": "快点，走向正确的未来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "3281c2b76b1f26585b063b0f095297eec8b548ba2b8fe9849565a11d561f2875", "ja": "モーガンじゃないが、教えてやる。\nお前は僕の拳を食らって、朝までおねんねだ。", "zh": "我虽然不是摩根，但可以教教你。你就吃下我这一拳，睡到早上吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1012_se", "source_sha256": "74b6f085fd4406e82fc48910c407f82e8c82c3e5b2ee0c2b96205c38bbf999ba", "ja": "ドカッ！", "zh": "咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "966b35e3b16a3cc45a5bdd6be263d2c854d1066db609cc6056cc7d11d428bf20", "ja": "あいつ、本当にきっかり36分後に戻ってきた。\nまるで予言だな……。", "zh": "那家伙真的分毫不差地在36分钟后回来了。\n简直就像预言一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "edf489a6d80750b4715daff78309f2651dd4e05f3304fe25696db4a7d997edfe", "ja": "そのとおりですよ、スタークス。\n私には、ほんの少し先の、未来を視る力があるんです。", "zh": "没错，斯塔克斯。\n我拥有能够看见稍稍靠后的未来的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "47801afa7eff0a1919da30d9390c53cb29601620ccb68f468933fe0a2f672efd", "ja": "未来視か……なるほどな。\nちょっと教えてやれば、相手はイチコロだろう。", "zh": "未来视啊……原来如此。只要稍微教给对方一点，对方就会立刻被拿下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "ea61179377402d1cabfb0f28a878f2d3c6b0ab48c7e8cf8911436173893003b4", "ja": "ええ。この力があるから、\n私は教祖をやれている。そういう事です。", "zh": "是的。正因为拥有这份力量，\n我才能当上教主。就是这么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "1068871159ba7a3ca36fe213eb123ac5292f38d6eb1535fbd8cd8078b18cc2fe", "ja": "それもこれも、兄が所属する政治団体への\n資金集めのためだったんですが……。", "zh": "这一切都是为了给哥哥所属的政治团体筹集资金……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "d7a54e35814acbd6d00288a7eb5f033e6f5d1a8488942e1b31ce3aa1518387c7", "ja": "そこで、『よくない未来』を視た……？", "zh": "所以，你在那里看到了“不好的未来”……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "61a93dcee3d28e2726a1e0762a0686e41449f22a177904e9fd96334e09a2141b", "ja": "ご明察。私は兄の手から逃れるため、いったん、\nミリニアムシティ監獄に身を隠したという訳です。", "zh": "猜得没错。为了逃离哥哥的掌控，我暂时藏身于米利尼亚姆城市监狱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "29ed2e45d20bf08953e301a356384cb6284252ac582ba6cd9966159160883610", "ja": "ミリニアムシティ監獄に入れられるのは凶悪犯罪者……\n本来なら、殺人を犯した者のみですからね。", "zh": "能被关进千禧城监狱的，都是穷凶极恶的罪犯……按理说，只有犯下杀人罪的人才会被关进去呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "e02464ff6d5c2fbf839a90b3506dcddf7d299044788cb5ebdf8384b6d602c60d", "ja": "だからって刑務所に身を隠すか？　普通。\n趣味が悪いな。", "zh": "就因为这样，就要躲进监狱里吗？一般人可不会这么做。趣味真差。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "3a3bc17046ab1e4c560213ee8e8442470205ee1d440f95a87f517abd2ddf5582", "ja": "物事を上手く進めるには、協力者が必要なんですよ。\nそれは、そこにいるイーサンもご存知だと思いますが。", "zh": "要想顺利推进事情，就需要协助者。\n我想，身在那里的伊森应该也知道这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "95f429da9841c994986d8b295e8f59dd7c21b1431bcc3afb59390ada818a84a6", "ja": "それより、どこか安全な場所に移動しましょう。\nこれについて、貴方がたと話がしたい。", "zh": "比起这个，我们还是先转移到安全的地方吧。\n我想和你们谈谈这件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1025_003mik", "source_sha256": "1689d45a9b730436879370e316759ba359f5cf9769bc8274bf15943ec51316d9", "ja": "これが、ハーマンが言っていたもの……\nアンジーが知った、秘密なのか？", "zh": "这就是哈曼说过的东西……是安吉得知的秘密吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1026_030iku", "source_sha256": "23e66b1887ee2aa38a76e72b1ab5f3c92a1b786819cf94f18fa65381e6efcc49", "ja": "これは……スパークドラッグだな。所謂パーティー\nドラッグで、確かに違法ではあるが……。", "zh": "这是……火花毒品吧。也就是所谓的派对毒品，确实是违法的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1027_030iku", "source_sha256": "0546cf23b78702837e67542bf6171c589c8aab94203d7c74f5dea8cfbc2ca351", "ja": "市場に出回っていて、それほど高いものじゃない。\n犯罪者を解放してまで追うものかと言われると……。", "zh": "在市场上流通得很广，也不算什么贵重的东西。\n要说值不值得特意放走犯人去追查的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "586be8ecb2d86acc06de3b7e3d049704ff6df43d518b583a9046a856fc9c5dbf", "ja": "これはスパークドラッグを隠れ蓑に改造したものです。\n多幸感、万能感などの効果はそのまま、副作用がない。", "zh": "这是以火花毒品为掩护改造出来的东西。  \n欣快感、万能感等效果依然保留，而且没有副作用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "e953f4a3c7d3c5404895e0251f609b645d53b92a8c7739b4a1d033e8d5f430be", "ja": "恐ろしいのは、中にナノマシンが混入されていること。\n摂取した人間を意のままに操る事も、不可能ではない。", "zh": "可怕的是，里面混入了纳米机器人。\n想要随心所欲地操纵摄入者，也并非不可能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "a8347978b7e3b8936d4b0bdb232e5a85751a86c62d3e96d92fae6ccb88a1c456", "ja": "体内でウィルスのように自己増殖し、脳を支配し、\nどんな命令でも聞かせられる……そういう代物です。", "zh": "在体内像病毒一样自我增殖，支配大脑，让人听从任何命令……就是这种东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1031_030iku", "source_sha256": "0a8ed062b6781863dec23ea57ba76260f66840606f6b2129b354e69000d1f2f6", "ja": "そうか。目立った副作用がなければ、常用者だけで\nなく、一般人も手を出す可能性があるな……。", "zh": "这样啊。要是没有明显的副作用，恐怕不只是常用者，\n连普通人也有可能会去尝试……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "b9ee48e097e21045ffb25a5766347d84ede0ebccd48f8b308c71b816b6efee93", "ja": "ええ。まずはそこから……。次にミリニアム市内で、\n少しずつ実験の場を広げていくつもりでしょう。", "zh": "嗯。先从那里开始……接下来，他们应该是打算在米利尼亚姆市内，逐步扩大实验范围吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1033_003mik", "source_sha256": "3c22b3ba719169a98d9d36bc4a604e1d6d0e67e9213c3b73c77e87549f465a6d", "ja": "ナノマシンで人を操るだって？　SF小説じゃ\nあるまいし、一体なんだって奴らはそんな事を……。", "zh": "用纳米机器操控人类？又不是科幻小说，他们到底为什么要做这种事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_05_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "173b273cee2a742099fd3a94900f2914639a66069eb2f195c581c573b993136a", "ja": "ところで、私達にはひとつ共通点があります。\nそれは全員、『特殊な能力がある』という事です。", "zh": "话说回来，我们有一个共同点。\n那就是所有人都“拥有特殊能力”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
